local.rules
Grouped by protocol and layer

Layer 3: IP & ICMP        (SID 100000–100999)

Layer 4: TCP & UDP        (SID 110000–110999)

DNS/NTP/SNMP Protocols    (SID 120000–120999)

HTTP/HTTPS               (SID 130000–130999)

SMTP & FTP               (SID 140000–140999)

Data Exfiltration & Policy (SID 150000–150999)

At the hundreds column each number represents:
0=info
3=low
5=medium
7=high
8-9=critical

e.g. 1390901 HTTP SSRF to EC2 (Critical)
